<title>UK: Whitbread half year profits up 14 percent.</title>
<headline>Whitbread half year profits up 14 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 27.10		 vs  23.66</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   6.25		 up   5.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     177.5		  vs 155.7</p>
<p> Turnover		     1.505		up  13 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 168 to 175 million stg.</p>
</text>
